# What `quarto use template ssus-lab/ssus_slides@<tag>` leaves out: the
# format's own demo decks and QA tools. Quarto already skips dotfiles,
# README.md, and _extensions/ (installed separately). Patterns must be bare:
# a rooted pattern (/demo/) matches nothing in .quartoignore (Quarto 1.11.9).
demo/
tools/
qa/
